      },
      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "Once agents are running, the question is simple: are they doing the job the right way?\n\nLet's take a closer look at agent performance in Foundry.",
      "demo_actions": "Open the Foundry post-deployment view and frame this chapter as performance inspection.",
