      "narrative": "Start with tracing. I want to see the path through the evidence: which records the agent read, and every step it took before it made a call.\n\nThat turns each run from a black box into something the team can actually inspect.",
      "demo_actions": "Open trace details for an invoice-review run. Show the sequence of evidence access and reasoning steps.",
