      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "Next, I turn to rubrics. This is where we define what good looks like. Just like a teacher uses a rubric to grade student work, rubrics guide how we evaluate the agent's work: is it reasoning correctly over the contract terms, using the right evidence, and producing a clear, defensible recommendation?\n\nThe system can even generate that rubric from the agent itself, so the team is not starting from a blank page.",
      "demo_actions": "Open Foundry rubric evaluators. Show criteria tied to contract reasoning, evidence use, and recommendation quality.",
      "screenshot": ".cutready/screenshots/20260703_034058_row-4.png",
      "narration": {
